Specifically, patches/vllm-0.25.1-chained-flow-tree.patch is a diff against vLLM
0.25.1 source files and, when applied, modifies:

  vllm/config/vllm.py
  vllm/model_executor/layers/mamba/gdn/qwen_gdn_linear_attn.py
  vllm/v1/attention/backends/flash_attn.py
  vllm/v1/sample/rejection_sampler.py
  vllm/v1/spec_decode/metadata.py
  vllm/v1/worker/gpu_model_runner.py

and adds:

  vllm/v1/spec_decode/tree_state.py
  vllm/v1/spec_decode/tree_gdn.py
  vllm/v1/spec_decode/tree_gdn_verify.py
  vllm/v1/spec_decode/tree_gdn_factor.py
  vllm/v1/spec_decode/tree_attn_fused.py

The patch is OPTIONAL and is required only for the branching-tree verify path.
The default install does not modify vLLM in any way.
